        "heading_aKj3Ej": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Aim.",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_KBXpzy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're Karen and Danielle, a mother and daughter team based in London, with a shared belief in slowing down the shopping process by extending the life of fashion that already exists. We launched My Circular Wardrobe in April 2020, and our aim is simple: to make you fall in love with secondhand fashion, hence our motto, \"Preloved at first sight.\" We want buying secondhand to feel luxurious, not like a compromise, because buying luxury doesn't always mean buying new.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
