    "image_with_text_xakCx9": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_MjBpBn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Mother.</h2><p></p><p>I'm Karen, and I love working alongside my daughter Danielle. I've spent over 20 years in the fashion industry, following in the footsteps of my grandparents, who began exporting fabrics across the globe in the early 1960s. There's always been a stigma around buying secondhand, but I've watched that shift,and I've always loved hunting for hidden treasures in charity shops myself. We wanted to build an online platform that offered that same thrill, but with a more luxurious, less time-consuming experience and at prices that stay genuinely affordable, unlike a lot of existing resale platforms. The idea for My Circular Wardrobe came to us in January 2020 and we launched the site three months later.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_MjBpBn"
      ],
      "settings": {
