      "blocks": {
        "text_4j7wce": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Daughter.</h2><p></p><p>I'm Danielle. Like my mum, I've spent nearly ten years in fashion, and I've always loved selling clothes. I've been listing my own wardrobe on eBay for over 15 years and hate seeing anything go to waste, sometimes to an extreme. I used to co-run an annual fashion event with Grazia magazine, selling discounted designer pieces for charity, before joining my mum supplying sustainable fabrics to designer brands. It took me a while to shop secondhand myself. I couldn't quite believe my glamorous mother was finding treasures in charity shops back in 2017, until she started showing me what she'd found and asking me to guess the price. Between her eye for a find and my love of selling, launching My Circular Wardrobe just made sense.</p><p></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_4j7wce"
      ],
